# From "Free Flow Journey in Focus 21" (Wave VI - Odyssey, CD3-6), the wave's
# capstone: framed as integrating everything the wave has taught. Moves
# through a felt "light" from F12 to F21 rather than a counted climb --
# echoes compoint.gws's "those who know, understand, and love you" phrasing.

@segment  free-flow-journey-focus-21
@title    Free Flow Journey — Focus 21
@levels   F21
@duration ~5m

say Floating comfortably in your energy body, notice the light surrounding you. Warm. Soft. Comfortable.
pause 8
say Relax into it. Feel grateful for the comfort, the peace, the love you find here.
pause 8
say Now begin to move through the light, carrying that feeling with you. Moving toward Focus 21. More and more.
pause 10
say Relax, and feel calm and comfortable in Focus 21.
pause 6
say Beyond this light are those who know, understand, and love you -- willing to help you experience more of Locale 2. Ask for their guidance. Be open to receive.
pause 10
say Ask for that assistance now.
hold 90
say Give thanks to those who've helped you. Know you can always reach them again -- all it takes is thinking of them, and their help is freely there.
pause 8
say Now it's time to return. Back to your starting point, back to your physical body. Back through the light, your energy body slowing as you go.
pause 10
say Settling back into place. More grounded. More here.
pause 8
say Relax, and remember what you've experienced.
pause 6
